'''Lucky Dags''' (幸福の犬 ''Kōfuku no Inu'', lit. "'''The Dog of Happiness'''") is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Dagshund]] introduced in [[Ritual Confusion (Monthly Event)|Ritual Confusion]]. It was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

