==Enemy==
Lucky Dags has great range, enough damage to eliminate many units instantly, and a quick attack cycle, but is hindered greatly by its Single Attacks. While a trivial threat on its own, it becomes dangerous in swarms as it becomes difficult to replace meatshields faster than they can kill them.

==Strategy==
Make sure to spam meatshields at all times. You can prioritize 75¢ units because in most cases Lucky Dags will delete stronger ones like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cats]] or [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cats]], although the use of [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] is still viable. This will allow lower ranged units to land hits, or allow Crowd-Controllers like [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] to disable it completely. Fast units may enter their attack faster than your meatshields can soak the damage, but this mostly comes into play when they're in groups.

